If you find a wand of polymorph lying around, pile up all those C and K
rations and zap 'em (as well as piles of armor, too, if you need
something like speed boots or whatever).  I ended up with 42 lembas
wafers and 40 food rations (from the same zap of the wand) that had a
heck of alot more food content than those C and K rations.  I put the
lembas wafers in a bag of holding, took a couple of food rations, and
left the rest piled up in various places in the dungeon.  I never had a
problem with food again.

